{
  "description": "Machine-readable recovery guarantees/targets. Metadata only: no credentials, no secret paths with values, no mutable production state, no backup contents. Ordinary RPO/RTO are PROPOSED targets with operator acceptance pending; critical classes carry safety rules instead of loss SLAs.",
